    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d294">

                <pb facs="0575" n="519" sameAs="frus:frus1876/pg519"/>

                <head>No. 284.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Fish to Mr. Cushing.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1875-10-01"><hi rendition="#italic">October</hi> 1,
                        1875</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Remonstrate strenuously against preferment; urge compliance with protocol and
                    promises.</p>
                <closer><signed>FISH, <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
